      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ae14b192f26cf1a6d66ba79|full_name}: they allow you to embed prefabs in other prefabs.\n\nSuppose you have a chess board set up. You individually prefab every piece with a pickup and a rigidbody, etc. Then you prefab the whole chess board.\n\nBut since nested prefabs don't exist yet, the chess board prefab is now one whole. If you change an individual chess piece prefab, these changes are *not* reflected in the whole set up chessboard prefab!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
